Package: traverse
Title: Spatial Passage Across Gridded Landscapes
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("John", "Humphreys", email = "john.humphreys@example.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: John Humphreys [aut, cre]
Maintainer: John Humphreys <john.humphreys@example.org>
Description: Estimates spatial passage across gridded landscapes between source
    and destination sets. The package separates a scientific target domain
    from a buffered computational domain so terminal nodes can be placed
    outside the area of interpretation.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
